<a href="https://www.cyberciti.biz/tips/recover-mysql-root-password.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer ">https://www.cyberciti.biz/tips/recover-mysql-root-password.html</a><sup id="fnref:1"><a href="#fn:1" class="footnote-ref" role="doc-noteref">1</a></sup><br>
cyberciti.biz:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>You can recover MySQL database server password with following five easy steps.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The five steps: stop the MySQL server; start it again with <code>--skip-grant-tables</code>, so it asks for no password; connect as root with <code>mysql -u root</code>; set a new password for root; stop the server and start it normally.</p>
<hr>
<p><em>Source: commit <a href="https://github.com/emecas/My-Notes/commit/7b66d4116d5a874edc6cf8feb0ffad395c2f9cef" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer "><code>7b66d41</code></a> in My-Notes, improved in <a href="https://github.com/emecas/My-Notes/commit/766e6e17fa4fd4bb2f2809a732b87c3e63f841a2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreffer "><code>766e6e1</code></a> (2026-11-24).</em></p>
